@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
hide circle
class Group
class "CalendarEvent" as Ev <<changed>> {
  group : Group [0..1]
  recurrence, exceptions
}
class Session
Group "1" -- "0..*" Ev : schedule >
Session "0..1" .. "1" Ev : occurrence of >
note bottom of Ev
  Coach edits the group's events.
  Website calendar shows the same events.
  Course series list becomes derived.
end note
@enduml
